'''Kolzoc Alley''' was an alleyway located on the [[space station]] [[Glavis Ringworld]] during the [[New Republic Era]]. After the [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty hunter]] completed his [[bounty]], [[Death|killing]] [[Kaba Baiz]], his employer revealed that the [[Mandalorian covert]] was located past Kolzoc Alley.<ref name="Return" />
